          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On May 23, 2010, around 10:45 PM, several people observed in the sky the movements of a bright orange object. It moved horizontally, then stopped before taking off vertically and disappearing over the horizon. No noise was heard during the observation, which lasted 5 minutes. No other testimonies about this phenomenon were collected. These people were likely witnesses to the passage of a Thai lantern.",
